  the horizon.\nThe Moon is 4° up in the WSW · dark sky.\nTimes for the M
 oon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: h
 ttps://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=-6.2886&lon=106.7179
